        "id": 0,
        "original_id": "37dc796d-3d72-5cdf-8027-44a9c6bfcb8f",
        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- People: Cheick Tioté, Sekou Cissé, Bassilia Sakanoko, Leoh Digbeu\n- Organizations: FC Bibo, Feyenoord, WS Woluwe, UTA Arad, CFR Cluj, Newcastle United\n- Roles: Defensive midfielder\n- Topics: Football academy, Player development\n\nFacts:\n- FC Bibo's academy produced several notable players, including Feyenoord's Sekou Cissé, WS Woluwe's Bassilia Sakanoko, UTA Arad's Leoh Digbeu, and Newcastle United's Cheick Tioté.\n- Leoh Digbeu played for UTA Arad while on loan from CFR Cluj.\n- Cheick Ismaël Tioté was born on 21 June 1986 and died on 5 June 2017.\n- Cheick Tioté was an Ivorian footballer.\n- Cheick Tioté played as a defensive midfielder.\n- Cheick Tioté played for Newcastle United.",
        "type": "TextSummary"
      },
      {
